  "traps": ["The live picker is the chat header menu's Picker(\"Model Preference\") over SettingsStore.fmPreference (ModelStatusIndicator.swift:18). ModelSelectorSheet and QuickModelPickerSheet also set SettingsStore.selectedModel, but only #Preview blocks create them (ModelSelectorSheet.swift:223; ModelQuickSelector, which opens QuickModelPickerSheet, at ModelStatusIndicator.swift:348). All three fresh sessions that ran without this slice named one of them as where you pick (A/B, 2026-09-28).", "SettingsStore.selectedModel picks the LLM service class and is set only inside SettingsStore (defaults and migration, the device upgrade); RAGService.rebuildLLMServicesFromSettings builds the answering service from it (RAGService.swift:1986-1989)."]
